        <item>
            <title>2.17.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 18:06:28 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>92</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.17.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features

- **Every launcher pane now has a sidebar row.** A launcher pane used to be invisible in the sidebar, so the Open block stopped matching the pane strip exactly when one was open. Its row is clickable to focus, closeable, and draggable like any other, and it stays anchored to the pane it sits behind when you reorder.
- **The MacroPad has a manual sleep mode.** Hold both outermost keys for a moment and the pad goes dark; any key wakes it, and that first press is swallowed instead of switching panes. Sleep persists across relaunches.

### Bug Fixes

- **Fixed the sidebar toggle button doing nothing after Save and Quit.** On a relaunch that restored your pane layout, clicking the sidebar button in the toolbar had no effect for the rest of that window's life — only Cmd+Opt+S and the View menu worked. Both paths work again.
]]></description>
