        <item>
            <title>2.16.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 11:15:08 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>90</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.16.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The split view now holds up to six panes side-by-side, raised from five. Cmd+1..6 focuses each pane, so a six-key MacroPad reaches every one of them — previously the pad's keys ran out before the pane cap did.

Panes past what the window can fit are still shown: the window stops growing at the screen edge and the detail column is shared equally between them.
]]></description>
